


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_69631eb7:


    "放学后。采购归来的三人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_08b5fbf8:



    voice "2RI_0556"
    rin "「今天一天都是下一会儿停一会儿的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_b0485be5:


    "现在也在飘雪。下的是不用打伞也行的小雪。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_61833473:



    voice "2FU_0471"
    fumi "「这种雪积不起来呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_5d578c93:


    "实际上，雪几乎没剩下多少。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_49604af1:


    "街上人流车流都不少，雪在柏油路和水泥地上化得比在泥土地上快。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_d8d3150d:



    voice "2RI_0557"
    rin "「太好了。要是有积雪的话有人就会像某人一样摔跟头」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_11a1a4d9:



    voice "2FU_0472"
    fumi "「啊哈哈哈，早上可真危险呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_13646ded:


    "今天早上，慌慌张张跑出去的阳菜差点因为雪摔了一跤。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_6d7130ef:


    "但是她可是运动神经的集合体。一边激烈地踏步，一边总算是重新取得了平衡，躲过一劫。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_eb1bf2e9:



    voice "2RI_0558"
    rin "「喂，那个谁」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_31e14c66:


    "向走在前头不参与对话的阳菜打了声招呼。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_92941509:



    voice "2HI_0540"
    hina "「想去海边啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_fac1d5cb:



    voice "2RI_0559"
    rin "「哈？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_095c72fa:


    "伦被阳菜突然的发言给吓了一跳。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_e8a87c82:



    voice "2HI_0541"
    hina "「所以说，大海」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_e67c1e30:



    voice "2RI_0560"
    rin "「不，我听到了。这么冷的说这个也太唐突了吧。你想去冬泳吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_828b3860:



    voice "2FU_0473"
    fumi "「不，听起来好冷～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_37be8565:


    "文光是听到就抱住身体发起了抖。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_e930c3fb:


    "想去寒冬的海边什么的，是演歌的歌词吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_0be948a9:



    voice "2HI_0542"
    hina "「不是啦。不是现在去，是夏天去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_5ffb6711:


    rin_fumi "「啊啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_cc355e4a:


    "伦和文一起理解了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_0070e04b:



    voice "2RI_0562"
    rin "「但是也好突然啊。在这么寒冷的风景里是怎么联想起大海的啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_3f68c448:



    voice "2HI_0543"
    hina "「刚才不是在超市里买了卡式炉的气罐吗。于是，说到气罐就会想起瓦斯，说到瓦斯（gas）就会想起巴士（bus）。说到巴士就会想起巴士站——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_975b2590:



    voice "2HI_0543a"
    hina "「于是，出了店就在下雪，不是有种东西叫marine snow吗——你看这不是海吗，锵——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_f683c531:



    voice "2RI_0563"
    rin "「锵你个头啊。前面说的一半都没意义吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_97993f63:



    voice "2HI_0544"
    hina "「真的诶！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_2b78711e:



    voice "2FU_0475"
    fumi "「啊哈哈。但是大家都想去海水浴场呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_f1806b5b:



    voice "2RI_0564"
    rin "「从这里去海边已经是去旅游的距离了吧？泳池不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_2c055576:


    hina_fumi "「不行哦」\n「不行」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_d75bb438:



    voice "2RI_0565"
    rin "「是吗。不光花时间还要花钱哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_92fd6b5b:



    voice "2FU_0477"
    fumi "「那就攒钱攒到夏天吧♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_c99c6674:



    voice "2RI_0566"
    rin "「哦、噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_c13ce4c9:



    voice "2FU_0478"
    fumi "「定一个规矩，每次有谁打破就存100日元」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_b85ac83f:



    voice "2HI_0546"
    hina "「就是小文一直在遵守的9点以后什么都不吃的规矩？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_74c4365e:



    voice "2HI_0547"
    hina "「就是浅生一直在遵守的9点以后什么都不吃的规矩？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_cec97ff5:



    voice "2FU_0479"
    fumi "「是的。就是这个。大家也一起来吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_fd867819:



    voice "2RI_0567"
    rin "「好哦。我9点以后也不吃东西了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_e30e55f3:



    voice "2HI_0548"
    hina "「我也来—」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_d9850783:



    voice "2FU_0480"
    fumi "「不行！你们两个本来不就不吃东西吗。那存钱的人就只有我一个了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_81177e57:


    "是觉得稍微吃点也是没办法的事情吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_a97fa0b3:



    voice "2FU_0481"
    fumi "「请把你们两个人也需要忍耐和努力的事情定成规矩」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_99269a7f:


    "阳菜和伦面面相觑。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_96f6f408:



    voice "2HI_0549"
    hina "「那伦每次忘带东西就存100日元」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_745a5ee3:



    voice "2RI_0568"
    rin "「咦～你是想去夏威夷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_92a45e85:



    voice "2HI_0550"
    hina "「你完全就没想改啊！稍微注意点吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_d3cd6658:



    voice "2FU_0482"
    fumi "「小阳菜要怎么办呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_48a7b0de:



    voice "2FU_0483"
    fumi "「夏目同学要怎么办呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_0171e46e:



    voice "2HI_0551"
    hina "「嗯。有没有什么……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_0c30f555:



    voice "2RI_0569"
    rin "「阳菜每次唱歌存100日元就行了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_2e256c5a:



    voice "2HI_0552"
    hina "「不要剥夺我表达的自由！」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_09_c8ea2637:


    "放学后。采购归来的三人。"
